:{"fname":"zettel.1777995556481","id":"zettel.1777995556481","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.20260505179969","position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":3,"offset":3058},"end":{"line":57,"column":28,"offset":3083},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.20260505179969"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777995556481","id":"zettel.1777995556481","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.20260505179980","position":{"start":{"line":58,"column":3,"offset":3145},"end":{"line":58,"column":28,"offset":3170},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.20260505179980"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777995556481","id":"zettel.1777995556481","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.overtrust","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":3,"offset":3303},"end":{"line":63,"column":31,"offset":3331},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.overtrust"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777995556481","id":"zettel.1777995556481","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.overtrust-evaluation","position":{"start":{"line":64,"column":3,"offset":3334},"end":{"line":64,"column":42,"offset":3373},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.overtrust-evaluation"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777995556481","id":"zettel.1777995556481","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.overtrust.workflow-detail","position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":3,"offset":3376},"end":{"line":65,"column":47,"offset":3420},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.overtrust.workflow-detail"}}],"anchors":{"kenapa-ini-penting":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa ini penting","value":"kenapa-ini-penting","line":26,"column":0,"depth":3},"apa-yang-harus-diaudit":{"type":"header","text":"Apa yang harus diaudit","value":"apa-yang-harus-diaudit","line":30,"column":0,"depth":3},"apa-bedanya-dengan-secret-scanner-biasa":{"type":"header","text":"Apa bedanya dengan secret scanner biasa","value":"apa-bedanya-dengan-secret-scanner-biasa","line":36,"column":0,"depth":3},"bentuk-idealnya":{"type":"header","text":"Bentuk idealnya","value":"bentuk-idealnya","line":40,"column":0,"depth":3},"atomic-idea-lain":{"type":"header","text":"Atomic idea lain","value":"atomic-idea-lain","line":47,"column":0,"depth":3},"hubungkan-ide-ini-dengan":{"type":"header","text":"Hubungkan ide ini dengan","value":"hubungkan-ide-ini-dengan","line":54,"column":0,"depth":3},"sumber":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber","value":"sumber","line":73,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"audit-trust-boundary-lokal-sebagai-ide-keamanan-developer\">Audit trust boundary lokal sebagai ide keamanan developer<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#audit-trust-boundary-lokal-sebagai-ide-keamanan-developer\"></a></h1>\n<p>Gue tangkep satu atomic idea penting: </p>\n<p>Audit keamanan developer harus memperlakukan workstation sebagai trust boundary.\nItu berarti fokus bukan hanya pada \"apakah ada secret di repo\", tapi juga pada:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>file/manifest lokal yang bisa mengalirkan akses atau secret</li>\n<li>proses yang jalan dengan privilege tinggi atau baca sensitive file</li>\n<li>tooling/extension yang punya izin runtime untuk mengeksekusi command atau akses auth</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Kalau idea ini diambil murni, outputnya adalah sebuah preflight check lokal: sebuah indicator untuk menilai apakah environment dev terlalu terbuka sebelum kasih tool agentic akses.</p>\n<h3 id=\"kenapa-ini-penting\">Kenapa ini penting<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kenapa-ini-penting\"></a></h3>\n<p>Karena di era agentic coding, risiko bukan hanya codebase. Workstation developer sendiri jadi channel attack surface.</p>\n<h3 id=\"apa-yang-harus-diaudit\">Apa yang harus diaudit<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#apa-yang-harus-diaudit\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>file credential dan config lokal, termasuk <code>~/.aws</code>, <code>~/.kube</code>, <code>.env</code>, <code>.npmrc</code></li>\n<li>manifest dan script yang bisa memicu <code>curl | bash</code>, auth provider, atau extension execution</li>\n<li>process dengan privilege tinggi atau sensitive FD</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"apa-bedanya-dengan-secret-scanner-biasa\">Apa bedanya dengan secret scanner biasa<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#apa-bedanya-dengan-secret-scanner-biasa\"></a></h3>\n<p>Secret scanner biasa cuma ngasih jawaban \"ada secret\" atau \"enggak\". Ide ini nambah konteks: \"siapa yang bisa akses secret itu sekarang?\" dan \"apa tool lokal yang bisa nge-trigger eksfiltrasi?\"</p>\n<h3 id=\"bentuk-idealnya\">Bentuk idealnya<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#bentuk-idealnya\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>deterministic, offline, lokal</li>\n<li>rule-based indicator, bukan verdict final</li>\n<li>outputnya bisa ditriage di workflow developer</li>\n<li>bisa jadi preflight sebelum tool agentic dijalankan</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"atomic-idea-lain\">Atomic idea lain<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#atomic-idea-lain\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Preflight indicator, bukan verdict: audit lokal harus jadi sinyal awal untuk triage, bukan klaim serangan pasti.</li>\n<li>Gabungkan file + manifest + process sebagai satu sinyal: deteksi risiko lebih kuat ketika secret/file warning dikaitkan dengan process privilege dan script/manifest execution.</li>\n<li>Local audit harus deterministik/offline: jangan tambah trust dependency baru dengan mengirim data ke cloud.</li>\n<li>Rule-based hardcoded cukup untuk prototype, tapi bentuknya harus warning/indicator supaya blind spot tidak jadi penilaian final.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"hubungkan-ide-ini-dengan\">Hubungkan ide ini dengan<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#hubungkan-ide-ini-dengan\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.overtrust-evaluation\">Evaluasi Overtrust: konsep bagus tapi rule-based dan belum all-cover</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.overtrust\">Overtrust: lokal workstation scanner untuk trust boundary, bukan bug scanner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.overtrust.workflow-detail\">Overtrust workflow detail: cara kerja local scanner dan trust boundary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.agentic-coding-permission-boundary\">Agentic coding permission boundary dan risiko filesystem lokal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.deepsec-docs\">Deepsec docs: workflow harness, bukan scanner sekali jalan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260421193301\">Methodology wajib ada supaya AI-assisted development tidak jadi chaos yang efisien</a> — methodology AI-assisted untuk mencegah chaos agentic.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260421174123\">BMAD Quick Dev mengoptimalkan attention manusia, bukan sekadar kecepatan model</a> — boundary cerdas sebelum model dibiarkan berjalan sendiri.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260419193541\">Plan AI bukan sekadar to-do list; ia adalah artefak governance operasional</a> — plan sebagai artefak governance operasional untuk preflight dan eksekusi aman.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179967\">Agentic coding tools adalah process dengan permission, bukan autocomplete</a> — agentic coding sebagai process dengan permission boundary.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179968\">Workstation trust boundary adalah attack surface utama di era AI-native engineering</a> — workstation trust boundary sebagai attack surface AI-native.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179971\">Deterministic local scanners melengkapi AI scanners dalam keamanan developer workflow</a> — local deterministic scanner melengkapi AI scanner.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179972\">Secret exposure bisa terjadi tanpa commit Git</a> — secret exposure bisa terjadi tanpa commit Git.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179946\">Workstation trust boundary jadi serangan utama di era agentic coding</a> — workstation trust boundary jadi serangan utama di era agentic coding.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179983\">Sandbox dan boundary adalah persyaratan untuk tool agentic aman</a> — sandbox dan boundary adalah persyaratan untuk tool agentic aman.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179969\">Security harness lebih penting daripada single AI agent</a> — security harness lebih penting daripada single AI agent.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179980\">Keamanan AI-native adalah kebiasaan harian, bukan event sekali jalan</a> — keamanan AI-native sebagai kebiasaan harian.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sumber\">Sumber<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>https://github.com/cheese-cakee/overtrust</code></li>\n<li><code>.references/overtrust</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.overtrust\">Overtrust: lokal workstation scanner untuk trust boundary, bukan bug scanner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.overtrust-evaluation\">Evaluasi Overtrust: konsep bagus tapi rule-based dan belum all-cover</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.overtrust.workflow-detail\">Overtrust workflow detail: cara kerja local scanner dan trust boundary</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">security (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">agentic-coding (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">trust-boundary (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enableUserTags":true,"enableHashTags":true,"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","enableAutoFoldFrontmatter":false,"enableEditorDecorations":true,"maxPreviewsCached":10,"maxNoteLength":204800,"seeds":{"dendron.templates":{}},"enableFullHierarchyNoteTitle":false},"preview":{"enableFMTitle":true,"enableNoteTitleForLink":true,"enableFrontmatterTags":true,"enableHashesForFMTags":false,"enablePrettyRefs":true,"enableKatex":true,"automaticallyShowPreview":false},"publishing":{"enableFMTitle":true,"enableNoteTitleForLink":true,"enablePrettyRefs":true,"enableKatex":true,"copyA